{"4159100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Destroyers", "steam_appid": 4159100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/3be5371b583683c12279d038dd9e32ef.avif?t=1774966501\" width=520 height=205 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY THE DUNGEON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or with up to 3 friends, you can venture down into the most chaotic and dangerous floors of The Dungeon to find it's core and destroy it for the greater good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/f41f7ab4565c7cefb3755e66b8270aca.poster.avif?t=1774966501\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/f41f7ab4565c7cefb3755e66b8270aca.webm?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/f41f7ab4565c7cefb3755e66b8270aca.mp4?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/0c30fb075ae5b2f87b4cb66517f5c936.poster.avif?t=1774966501\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/0c30fb075ae5b2f87b4cb66517f5c936.webm?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/0c30fb075ae5b2f87b4cb66517f5c936.mp4?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/2a1896a52ff4db73b318fa01f408eb2d.poster.avif?t=1774966501\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/2a1896a52ff4db73b318fa01f408eb2d.webm?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/2a1896a52ff4db73b318fa01f408eb2d.mp4?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-attacking weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick or Long runs based on preference (20-30 minutes or 40-60 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Races and Classes to combine for all sorts of different builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapons and items to find, buy and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies and fight epic multi-phase bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different floors with random events every run </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new races, classes and items by doing challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Dungeon Depth levels that increase difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alternative game modes like Boss Rush and Trials (premade dungeons) </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/3be5371b583683c12279d038dd9e32ef.avif?t=1774966501\" width=520 height=205 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY THE DUNGEON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or with up to 3 friends, you can venture down into the most chaotic and dangerous floors of The Dungeon to find it's core and destroy it for the greater good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/f41f7ab4565c7cefb3755e66b8270aca.poster.avif?t=1774966501\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/f41f7ab4565c7cefb3755e66b8270aca.webm?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/f41f7ab4565c7cefb3755e66b8270aca.mp4?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/0c30fb075ae5b2f87b4cb66517f5c936.poster.avif?t=1774966501\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/0c30fb075ae5b2f87b4cb66517f5c936.webm?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/0c30fb075ae5b2f87b4cb66517f5c936.mp4?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/2a1896a52ff4db73b318fa01f408eb2d.poster.avif?t=1774966501\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/2a1896a52ff4db73b318fa01f408eb2d.webm?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/extras/2a1896a52ff4db73b318fa01f408eb2d.mp4?t=1774966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-attacking weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick or Long runs based on preference (20-30 minutes or 40-60 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Races and Classes to combine for all sorts of different builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapons and items to find, buy and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies and fight epic multi-phase bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different floors with random events every run </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new races, classes and items by doing challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Dungeon Depth levels that increase difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alternative game modes like Boss Rush and Trials (premade dungeons) </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Dungeon Destroyers is a top-down arena survivor rogue-lite where you and up to 3 friends slay thousands of enemies and bosses while diving deeper into the dungeon to find it's core and destroy it. Choose from a variety of races, classes and items to create unique synergies and DESTROY THE DUNGEON.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/eeff8191eb11f52ec8aa36d04e010a40b1288658/header.jpg?t=1774966501", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/c26c6f8c9bae5d7d5ed041782e6b492994dbf66a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774966501", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159100/c26c6f8c9bae5d7d5ed041782e6b492994dbf66a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17749